Data Transformation: map() can be used to transform the data in some way1. For example, you can square each number in a list:
Java

List<Integer> numbers = Arrays.asList(1, 2, 3, 4, 5);
List<Integer> squares = numbers.stream()
    .map(n -> n * n)
    .collect(Collectors.toList());

